      "sequence_position": 16,
      "problem": "Consider the matrix $A$ given below.\nWhich entries of $A$ could be replaced by $0$ in order to get a matrix in row echelon form?\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
